                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <h1 style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 29px"><span style="font-family:宋体">十八而志梦起航</span><span style="font-family:宋体">青春向党筑未来</span></span></strong></h1><p style="text-align:center;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">——在绍兴一中</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">20</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">2</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">3</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">届高三</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">18岁</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">成人礼</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">上的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">致辞</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">
</span><span style=";font-family:楷体;line-height:150%;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:楷体">王</span>  <span style="font-family:楷体">琛</span></span></p><p style="line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">亲爱的同学</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">们，大家</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">下午好！</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">今天将会是一个值得在场每一位同学</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">永远铭记</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">的日子。因为</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">我们</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">隆重集会，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">集体</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">举行</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">202</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">3</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">届高三</span>18岁成人</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">仪式，共贺同学们</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">18岁生日</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，就是想用这样的形式郑重宣告：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">迈过成人的门槛，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">你们</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">将</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">成为中华人民共和国最年轻的一代成年公民</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，将</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">开启</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">崭新</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">的人生旅程</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">！在此，请允许我</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">代表学校</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">及我个人向</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">同学们</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">表示最热烈的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">祝贺</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">和最美好的祝福！</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">习近平总书记在二十大报告中强调：全党要把青年工作作为战略性工作来抓。你们恰逢其时！</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">在场的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">每一个你</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，正是我们</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">一中</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">要为国家和社会输送的最新一批能够担当大任的时代新人</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">。</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">十八岁了，意味着告别少年走向青年，告别幼稚走向成熟</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，为此，作为校长，我有</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">三</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">点希望与</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">大家</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">共勉：</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">一是</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">希望你们独立自信，</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">勇于担当，</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">不惧前行。</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">18岁后，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">你们将获得更多的权利和责任</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">：可以参加</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">选举，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">可以考取驾照</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">可以</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">有资格</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">去</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">献血</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">可以申请加入中国共产党</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">可以拿起</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">更多</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">法律的武器维护自己合法的权益</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">等等，能做</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">许多从前</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">因</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">年龄限制</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">而不能</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">做的事。但也因此，你们需要承担更多的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">义务和担当：</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">18岁后</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，你们的一言一行都将直接</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">受到</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">来自社会的道德评判、法律考验和科学考量。所以，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">希望</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">从今天开始，你们要</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">更加</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">尊法、知法、守法，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">更加独立</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">理性思考、诚实守信，修身齐家治国平天下</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">成为一个对家庭、对学校、对社会、对国家</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">特别是对自己的言行和人生更有责任</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">和担当</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">的人。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">二是</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">希望你们自强不息</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">，敢于</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">拼搏</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">，不负当下</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">。</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">今天</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">距离首考</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">还有</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">33天</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，距离明年</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">6月</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">终考已不到</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">七个月</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">的时间。不论是</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">眼前的首</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">考还是</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">后续的高考终考</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，都</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">会</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">对你们未来的人生有着不言而喻的影响</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">。希望</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">你们凭借自信、智慧、勇气、体魄以及壮士断腕的决心，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">用斗争拼搏精神，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">竭尽全力来面对挑战</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">让父母</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">、老师</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">不再</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">因</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">你</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">“躺平”</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">而</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">担心</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">焦虑</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，也给自己</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">阶段性的努力交上一份满意</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">答卷</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">。</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">所以说今天的仪式也是首考迎考的再动员、再出发！</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">不论当下如何，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">我相信你们每个人都</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">会直面困难，勇于接受当下高考将面临的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">考验</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">和</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">挑战！</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">预祝</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">同学们考出理想</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">的</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">成绩</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">！</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">三是希望你们</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">爱国报国，懂于</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">感恩</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 150%;font-size: 21px">，不虚年华。</span></strong><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">“无穷的远方，无数的人们，都与我有关。”</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，所以</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">你们</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">要</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">自觉践行</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">社会主义核心价值</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">观</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">积极弘扬中华优秀传统文化，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">牢记</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">“为他人</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">谋幸福</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">为中华民族谋复兴</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">”</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">初心使命，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">在祖国第二个一百年征程中，把个人的命运与祖国的命运统一起来，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">把个人理想同</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">“</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">以中国式现代化全面推进中华民族伟大复兴</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">”的使命</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">紧密联系起来。要懂得饮水思源，感恩生你养你的父母，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">感恩</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">教你育你的师长，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">感恩</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">伴你助你的朋友，感恩社会和这个伟大的时代</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">用实际行动</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">绽放</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">自己</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">最绚烂的芳华</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">。</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">同学们，成人不仅仅只是一场仪式，你们也并非在这一刻就长大成人，但我相信，你们</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">一定会</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">记住这一庄严时刻</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">的承诺</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，趁阳光正好、趁青春正盛、趁芳华正美、趁志气正高，去</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">奋斗</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">，去</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">拼搏！</span><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">十八而志，青春万岁！希望在未来的日子里，你们都能够实现理想，成长为自己最喜欢的模样！</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;line-height:150%"><span style=";font-family:仿宋;line-height:150%;font-size:21px">谢谢！</span></p><p>
</p>
    
